{% extends 'vitrine/layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}MOSLTRANS — Transport et logistique à Metz{% endblock %}

{% block body %}

<!-- ============================== HERO ============================== -->
<div class="hero" id="accueil">
  <div class="hero-img"></div>
  <div class="hero-veil"></div>

  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <img class="hero-logo" src="{{ asset('images/logo-blanc.png') }}" alt="MOSLTRANS — Logistique et transport">

        <h1>Le transport de vos marchandises <em>en toute confiance</em></h1>

        <p class="lead">Des solutions de transport fiables et sur mesure, adaptées à vos besoins, partout en France depuis Metz.</p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="{{ path('app_devis') }}">Demander un devis →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ path('app_home') }}#services">Nos services</a>
        </div>

        <div class="plus">
          <div>
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9v7H3z"/><path d="M12 10h4l3 3v2h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.9"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="17" r="1.9"/><path d="M1 7h2M1 10h3M1 13h2"/></svg>
            <span>Livraison<br>partout en France</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.4-3 7.7-7 9-4-1.3-7-4.6-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            <span>Suivi en temps réel<br>de vos envois</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M2.5 19c0-3.3 2.9-5.2 6.5-5.2s6.5 1.9 6.5 5.2"/><path d="M16.5 7.2a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.6"/><path d="M18 14.2c2.2.6 3.5 2.1 3.5 4.3"/></svg>
            <span>Une équipe<br>à votre écoute</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================== SERVICES ============================== -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-2 rev">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">NOS SERVICES</p>
        <h2>Des solutions de transport adaptées à vos besoins</h2>
      </div>
      <p>MOSLTRANS accompagne les entreprises pour le transport de leurs marchandises, du lot partiel au lot complet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v8H3z"/><path d="M14 10h4l3 3v2h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Transport national</h3>
        <p>Lots complets ou partiels acheminés partout en France, au départ du Grand Est.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="national">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Transport express</h3>
        <p>Enlèvement rapide et livraison en urgence quand vos délais sont serrés.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="express">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card hl rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Suivi des envois</h3>
        <p>Suivez votre marchandise étape par étape, du chargement jusqu’à la livraison.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="suivi">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5-9 5z"/><path d="M3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Transport sur mesure</h3>
        <p>Des solutions adaptées à vos marchandises volumineuses ou spécifiques.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="mesure">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.8-7 9-4-1.2-7-4.5-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Sécurité et fiabilité</h3>
        <p>Véhicules entretenus, marchandises assurées et délais annoncés puis tenus.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="securite">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card rev">
        <span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-9 8.4 9 9 0 0 1-3.8-.8L3 21l1.9-4.6A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 12 3a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 9 8.5z"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Accompagnement</h3>
        <p>Un interlocuteur unique qui répond à vos questions avant, pendant et après.</p>
        <a class="more" data-service="accompagnement">EN SAVOIR PLUS →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================== SUIVI ============================== -->
<section class="suivi" id="suivi">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="suivi-grid">

      <div class="rev">
        <p class="eyebrow">SUIVI DE VOTRE LIVRAISON</p>
        <h2>Suivez votre envoi en temps réel</h2>
        <p class="sub">Entrez votre numéro de suivi pour connaître l’état de votre livraison.</p>

        <form class="search-group" id="track-form" data-url="{{ path('app_suivi', {reference: 'REFERENCE'}) }}">
          <svg class="loupe" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2.1" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
          <span class="champ">
            <input type="text" id="ref" placeholder="Exemple : MOSL-7K4P-2QX9" aria-label="Numéro de suivi" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="40">
          </span>
          <button type="submit">Rechercher</button>
        </form>
        <p class="track-err" id="track-err" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <div class="steps" id="steps">
          <div class="step"><span class="b"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span>Commande<br>reçue</div>
          <div class="step"><span class="b"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span>Chargement</div>
          <div class="step"><span class="b"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7h10v8H3z"/><path d="M13 10h4l3 3v2h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.7"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="1.7"/></svg></span>En transit</div>
          <div class="step"><span class="b"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5v8l-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v10"/></svg></span>Arrivée</div>
          <div class="step"><span class="b"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 11l8-6 8 6v9H4z"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></span>Livrée</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="map-card rev">
        {# vraie carte (OpenStreetMap), chargée seulement après une recherche réussie #}
        <div class="carte-reelle" id="carte-reelle" hidden></div>
        <svg class="map" viewBox="0 0 1200 520" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-label="Carte du trajet routier entre Metz et Paris">
          <rect width="1200" height="520" fill="#f2efe9"/>

          <path d="M0 0h1200v120C1000 152 840 96 620 124S170 176 0 140Z" fill="#e8efe1"/>
          <path d="M0 396c220-34 380 42 640 10s420-62 560-30v144H0Z" fill="#e9f0e2"/>
          <ellipse cx="220" cy="196" rx="150" ry="52" fill="#dfe9d4"/>
          <ellipse cx="980" cy="330" rx="170" ry="60" fill="#dfe9d4"/>
          <ellipse cx="620" cy="86" rx="130" ry="40" fill="#dfe9d4"/>

          <path d="M0 318C180 300 320 344 500 332s320-72 520-62 130 18 180 12" fill="none" stroke="#bcd9ef" stroke-width="9"/>
          <path d="M820 520c-16-94 36-158 112-208s110-116 100-192" fill="none" stroke="#bcd9ef" stroke-width="6"/>

          <path d="M170 392C330 348 430 302 580 266s330-96 430-150" fill="none" stroke="#f6d78a" stroke-width="18"/>
          <path d="M170 392C330 348 430 302 580 266s330-96 430-150" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="11"/>
          <path d="M0 226C240 214 500 258 740 240s330-66 460-42" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="8" opacity=".9"/>
          <path d="M120 520C240 400 210 300 330 224S560 84 640 0" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="7" opacity=".75"/>

          <path d="M1020 152C900 208 770 250 640 286c-150 42-260 70-420 108" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="7.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>

          <circle cx="760" cy="248" r="5.5" fill="#64748b"/>
          <text x="772" y="243" font-size="14" fill="#475569" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Verdun</text>
          <circle cx="470" cy="318" r="5.5" fill="#64748b"/>
          <text x="482" y="313" font-size="14" fill="#475569" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Reims</text>
          <text x="640" y="208" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#b45309" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">A4</text>

          <g transform="translate(1020,152)">
            <path d="M0 -36C15 -36 24 -25 24 -12 24 5 0 27 0 27S-24 5-24 -12c0-13 9-24 24-24Z" fill="#2a78cc"/>
            <circle cy="-13" r="8.5" fill="#fff"/>
          </g>
          <g transform="translate(200,398)">
            <path d="M0 -36C15 -36 24 -25 24 -12 24 5 0 27 0 27S-24 5-24 -12c0-13 9-24 24-24Z" fill="#e11d48"/>
            <circle cy="-13" r="8.5" fill="#fff"/>
          </g>
          <g transform="translate(628,288)">
            <circle r="20" fill="#0b2b5e"/>
            <g transform="translate(-11,-9) scale(0.96)" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 3h12v9H1z"/><path d="M13 6h5l3 3v3h-8z"/><circle cx="5" cy="14" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="14" r="1.6"/></g>
          </g>

          <rect x="980" y="120" rx="8" width="132" height="52" fill="#fff" opacity=".95"/>
          <text x="998" y="144" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#0f172a" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Metz</text>
          <text x="998" y="163" font-size="13" fill="#475569" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Départ</text>

          <rect x="86" y="388" rx="8" width="142" height="52" fill="#fff" opacity=".95"/>
          <text x="104" y="412" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#0f172a" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Paris</text>
          <text x="104" y="431" font-size="13" fill="#475569" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">Destination</text>

          <g transform="translate(60,482)">
            <rect width="90" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#475569"/>
            <rect y="-4" width="2" height="11" fill="#475569"/><rect x="88" y="-4" width="2" height="11" fill="#475569"/>
            <text x="100" y="7" font-size="12.5" fill="#475569" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial">50 km</text>
          </g>
        </svg>

        <div class="info">
          <div class="top">
            <span class="ref" id="map-ref">Votre envoi</span>
            <span class="tag tag-attente" id="map-tag">En attente</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px"><path d="M4 11l8-6 8 6v9H4z"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg>
            <span><p class="k">Départ</p><p class="v" id="map-depart">—</p></span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.4"/></svg>
            <span><p class="k">Destination</p><p class="v" id="map-arrivee">—</p></span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2a78cc" stroke-width="1.9" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
            <span><p class="k">Dernière mise à jour</p><p class="v" id="map-maj">Saisissez votre numéro</p></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="zoom">
          <button type="button" aria-label="Zoomer">+</button>
          <button type="button" aria-label="Dézoomer">−</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================== VIDÉO ============================== -->
<div class="video" id="plateforme">
  <div class="video-img" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="slide s1 on"></div>
    <div class="slide s2"></div>
    <div class="slide s3"></div>
    <div class="slide s4"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="video-veil"></div>
  <div class="wrap video-in">
    <div>
      <span class="chip">NOTRE PLATEFORME EN VIDÉO</span>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2 style="margin:0">Découvrez comment<br>fonctionne <em>MOSLTRANS</em></h2>
      <p>Une plateforme simple, fiable et performante pour gérer vos transports en toute sérénité.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================== À PROPOS ============================== -->
<section id="apropos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-card rev">
      <div class="about-img" role="img" aria-label="Employé MOSLTRANS dans un entrepôt logistique"></div>

      <div class="about-txt">
        <p class="eyebrow">À PROPOS</p>
        <h2>MOSLTRANS</h2>

        <p>Basée à Metz, MOSLTRANS accompagne les entreprises du Grand Est pour le transport de leurs marchandises. Nos équipes suivent chaque envoi, du chargement à la livraison, et vous tiennent informés à chaque étape.</p>

        <p>Notre objectif est simple : des délais tenus et un interlocuteur toujours joignable.</p>

        <a class="btn" href="{{ path('app_contact') }}">Nous contacter →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================== CHIFFRES ============================== -->
<div class="stats">
  <div class="wrap stats-grid">
    <div class="col"><p class="num">15</p><p class="cap">ANS D’EXPÉRIENCE</p></div>
    <div class="col"><p class="num">24 h</p><p class="cap">POUR VOUS RÉPONDRE</p></div>
    <div class="col"><p class="num">100 %</p><p class="cap">FRANCE</p></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================== TÉMOIGNAGES ============================== -->
<section id="avis">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="avis-head rev">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">TÉMOIGNAGES CLIENTS</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,34px);margin:10px 0 0">Ils nous font confiance</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="arrows">
        <button class="icon-btn" id="prev" aria-label="Témoignage précédent"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b2b5e" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="next" aria-label="Témoignage suivant"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b2b5e" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="avis-window">
      <div class="avis-track" id="track">

        <div class="avis-slide">
          <article class="avis"><p class="stars" aria-label="Note : 5 sur 5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg></p><p>Un partenaire fiable et professionnel. Nos livraisons partent à l’heure et arrivent dans les délais annoncés.</p><div class="who"><span class="ava">TL</span><span><p class="nm">Thomas L.</p><p class="fn">Responsable logistique</p></span></div></article>
          <article class="avis"><p class="stars" aria-label="Note : 5 sur 5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg></p><p>Une vraie réactivité sur les demandes urgentes, et un interlocuteur qui connaît nos dossiers.</p><div class="who"><span class="ava">SM</span><span><p class="nm">Sophie M.</p><p class="fn">Directrice d’exploitation</p></span></div></article>
          <article class="avis"><p class="stars" aria-label="Note : 4 sur 5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#facc15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#facc15" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6l2.9 5.9 6.5.9-4.7 4.6 1.1 6.5-5.8-3-5.8 3 1.1-6.5L2.6 9.4l6.5-.9z"/></svg></p><p>Le suivi des envois nous fait gagner du temps : nous savons où se trouve la marchandise.</p><div class="who"><span class="ava">JK</span><span><p class="nm">Julien K.</p><p class="fn">Gérant</p></span></div></article>
